 o let us at askusSPL@sherwoodoregon.gov to let us know you’re attending
 .\nWe meet the following Thursday dates from 4:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m.\nMay 7
 \nMay 21\nJune 4\nJune 18\nWe don’t meet in July\nAugust 6\nAugust 20\nS
 eptember 3\nSeptember 17\nOctober 1\nOctober 15\nNovember 5\nNovember 19\n
 December 3\nDecember 17
