BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sit & Stitch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T140000
UID:69a606b719c54125aa02300c@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join other fiber and textile crafters for a social gathering o
 n the first Saturday of each month. Bring a project to work on and we’ll
  provide the coffee and tea! Crafters of all skills levels are encouraged 
 to join. Limited supplies and access to online tutorials will be provided\
 ; however\, instruction will not be available.
LOCATION:Aloha Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a606b719c54125aa02300c
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:STEAM Lab: Flower Power
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T163000
UID:6a0c80c73246e7b84b500c19@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover the power of flowers! In this interactive STEAM Lab\,
  we'll explore the biology of flowering plants from weeds to wildflowers. 
 Dissect a flower and identify its parts\, learn about capillary action\, p
 ress flowers to preserve their beauty\, and more! For children ages 5 and 
 up with their grown ups.
LOCATION:Aloha Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0c80c73246e7b84b500c19
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
