DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260618T113000
UID:69fe6fdec7d3cd580057ffcd@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Beaverton City Library will be out in the community this summe
 r with storytimes\, crafts\, and family activities in THPRD parks. Note: T
 his event is at Camille Park (10299 SW Marjorie Ln)\, not Beaverton City L
 ibrary. All ages.
