BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cocinando con los Niños | Cooking for Kids
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T123000
UID:6a0e342e8e677a28001d5f89@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:¡Actividad para toda la familia! Prepararemos recetas fácile
 s y saludables. Nosotros ponemos todos los materiales. ¡Ustedes solo trae
 n ganas de divertirse y aprender cosas nuevas!  Esta es una serie de 6 cla
 ses.\nAn activity for the whole family! We'll prepare easy and healthy rec
 ipes. We'll provide all the materials. All you need is a desire to have fu
 n and learn new things! This is a series of 6 classes.
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Shute Park
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0e342e8e677a28001d5f89
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sound Bath Meditation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260618T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260618T190000
UID:6a122e698ea300e263181e36@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Relax and rejuvenate with Melissa Felsenstein of Inner Sounds 
 Meditation. Specially tuned crystal bowls and gongs create a sound bath to
  help alleviate stress and ease listeners into meditative states. No yoga 
 is practiced\, simply sit or lay down and be immersed in meditative sounds
 . Bring your yoga mat or blanket if you want to stretch out on the floor!
LOCATION:Tigard Public Library\, Burgess Community Room
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a122e698ea300e263181e36
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
