BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:International Storytime - Korean
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260617T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260617T194500
UID:6a0fa88043b41b3d006842be@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Stories\, songs\, and movement activities\, presented in Korea
 n for children ages 0-6 with an adult. Third Wednesdays at 7 pm.\n세계 
 동화 시간 - 한국어\n설명\n0~6세 어린이(성인 동반)를 대
 상으로 하여 한국어로 진행되는 이야기 및 노래\, 율동 
 활동입니다. 매달 셋째 주 수요일 오후 7시에 진행됩니
 다.\n#worldlanguagestorytimes
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Brookwood
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0fa88043b41b3d006842be
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Toddler Time (2-3 years)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260618T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260618T104500
UID:69fe764c43b41b3d006533e3@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Raise a reader with the library! Enjoy stories\, songs and mov
 ement when you come to our interactive storytimes. Storytimes are 20-30 mi
 nutes. Stay afterwards to chat and play!\nAll storytimes are FREE and open
  to the public. Space is limited for all storytimes. Entry tickets are ava
 ilable at the Children’s Desk starting at 10 AM
LOCATION:Tigard Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fe764c43b41b3d006533e3
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"But I’m a Cheerleader" Movie Bingo
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T200000
UID:69fe603cc7d3cd580057fcef@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Break out your pom poms! Join drag queen Pluto for an evening 
 of laughs as we watch this beloved LGBTQ+ classic film. Enjoy popcorn and 
 drinks while competing for Bingo prizes. About the movie: In this high-glo
 ss\, high-camp satire\, all-American teenage pom pom shaker Megan Bloomfie
 ld (Natasha Lyonne) is blindsided when her parents send her to a reparativ
 e conversion therapy camp called True Directions. There\, she meets\, and 
 falls for\, the rebellious Graham (Clea DuVall). Doors open at 6 PM.\n1999
 . Directed by Jamie Babbit. Runtime: 1 hour and 25 minutes. Rated R.
LOCATION:Beaverton City Library\, Auditorium
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fe603cc7d3cd580057fcef
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intermediate ESL Provided by Goodwill Industries
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260602T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260602T190000
UID:69ea96208ddc1caf5f1ee661@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This class focuses on intermediate grammar\, reading\, writing
 \, listening\, and speaking skills for those who have basic reading and wr
 iting skills in English.
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Shute Park
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ea96208ddc1caf5f1ee661
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pre-Beginner ESL Class Provided by Goodwill Industries
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T190000
UID:69d6c9fefca21471b7eea62f@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This class is an introduction to basic grammar\, reading\, wri
 ting\, listening\, and speaking skills for students who can read and write
  in their first language. Students will receive a free textbook as a part
  of the class. We will work together to learn new vocabulary\, sentence pa
 tterns\, and communication using simple English.\nEsta clase es una introd
 ucción a las habilidades básicas de gramática\, lectura\, escritura\, c
 omprensión auditiva y expresión oral para estudiantes que pueden leer y 
 escribir en su primer idioma. Los estudiantes recibirán un libro de texto
  gratuito como parte de la clase. Trabajaremos juntos para aprender vocabu
 lario nuevo\, patrones de oraciones y comunicación usando un inglés simp
 le.
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Brookwood
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d6c9fefca21471b7eea62f
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
