BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chigiri-e Art Workshop with Project Tsubomi & Grassroots Gallery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T150000
UID:6a0b9229e8af4a2f007366fb@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover chigiri-e (ちぎり絵)\, a traditional Japanese art
  form dating back to the Heian period\, where hand-torn dyed washi paper i
 s layered to create stunning\, watercolor-like images. In this hands-on wo
 rkshop\, teens will create their own chigiri-e art piece using provided ma
 terials\, with optional templates available for guidance.
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Shute Park
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0b9229e8af4a2f007366fb
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
