BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:West Slope Neighborhood Cafe
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T180000
UID:699de2e71e64afd01e5db10b@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have you been wanting to get to know your neighbors better? Ge
 t involved in your community? The Neighborhood Cafe is a monthly all-ages 
 program is geared toward building relationships and fostering community re
 silience. It is lightly-structured to encourage conversation. Refreshments
  are provided. Every third Saturday of the month.
LOCATION:West Slope Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699de2e71e64afd01e5db10b
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
