DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T180000
UID:699de2e71e64afd01e5db10a@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The West Slope Neighborhood Cafe June meeting is canceled.\nHa
 ve you been wanting to get to know your neighbors better? Get involved in 
 your community? The Neighborhood Cafe is a monthly all-ages program is gea
 red toward building relationships and fostering community resilience. It i
 s lightly-structured to encourage conversation. Refreshments are provided.
  Every third Saturday of the month.
