 e StoryWalk® Project was created by Anne Ferguson of Montpelier\, VT and
  developed in collaboration with the Kellogg-Hubbard Library.\nProgram pre
 sented in partnership with Friends of the Tigard Library.
LOCATION:Tigard Public Library
