DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260609T143000
UID:69f2829cfb87a3c2e2acbbd1@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The internet can be an excellent source for learning more abou
 t your or a loved one’s health. This presentation will introduce you to 
 the topics and tools offered on two reputable websites\, MedlinePlus and M
 ayo Clinic. You’ll also learn how to evaluate health-related information
  online.\nPresented by Meals on Wheels People. While all are welcome at th
 is lecture\, the curriculum is designed for adults ages 55+.\nRegistration
  is required.
