DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T111500
UID:69ceaf6f81b67dfe32b0aab5@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Ready\, Set\, Kindergarten is a special 5-class series designe
 d for families. We will help you and your child get ready for Kindergarten
  with music\, stories\, art\, and play! All participants get a free book a
 t each class they attend. Ages 4-5.\nMay 19: Read to Learn\nMay 21: Let's
  Be Friends\nMay 26: Reading & Writing\nMay 28: Let's Talk\nMay 30: Playin
 g Together
LOCATION:Beaverton Murray Scholls
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ceaf6f81b67dfe32b0aab5
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Impactful Resume Writing (Resume Essentials Workshop with Goodwill
  Industries)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T113000
UID:6a0e53b68e677a28001d67df@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Academic and vocational organizations review resumes for seven
  seconds before determining  whether the candidate should move to the next
  round of evaluation. Learn the required sections of a resume  and begin t
 o create your unique resume story in order to stand out in the crowd.
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Brookwood
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0e53b68e677a28001d67df
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
