UID:69fe7a57f89ee1580051926d@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Read to a certified therapy dog in a stress-free environment! 
 Sign-up for a 20-minute reading session. Please register for only one read
 ing session per child per month. Call 503-718-2656\, stop by the Children
 ’s Desk\, or\nregister online\n. Registration opens around the first of 
 each month.\nProgram presented in partnership with Friends of the Tigard L
 ibrary\, an independent nonprofit dedicated to promoting\, enhancing\, an
 d expanding the services which the Library provides to our community. Lear
 n more at\ntigardlibraryfriends.org\n.
