SUMMARY:AARP Smart Driver Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T160000
UID:69bb3aec5a2d780f42c40cb8@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The AARP Smart Driver™ course is designed to enhance your dr
 iving skills and might also help you save on your auto insurance. The clas
 s runs for 6 hours\, starting at 9 AM and ending at 4 PM. There will be a 
 1-hour lunch break\, so please bring your lunch. If you are an AARP member
 \, remember to bring your AARP membership number.
LOCATION:Cornelius Public Library
