DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T180000
UID:6a0c7e7d43b41b3d006782a5@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Need practice reading? Clementine can help! Children learning 
 or struggling to read can register for a 15 minute reading session between
  5-6 pm on fourth Wednesdays this summer to practice their skills and mak
 e a new friend with trained therapy cat Clementine.\nSign up by visiting t
 he library or calling (503) 259-0185\n. Please limit one session per month
 \, up to two per quarter.
LOCATION:Aloha Community Library
