BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fun Farm | Granja de diversión
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T170000
UID:69fa923043b41b3d006473ce@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come for some casual farm themed fun! We'll have goats\, rabbi
 ts\, chickens\, and maybe more. Play games\, interact with animals\, and e
 njoy activities that celebrate our town's agricultural heritage!\nFun for 
 all ages.\n¡Ven a divertirte en un ambiente campestre! Tendremos cabras\,
  conejos\, gallinas y quizás más animales. ¡Juega\, interactúa con los
  animales y disfruta de actividades que celebran la tradición agrícola d
 e nuestro pueblo!\nDiversión para todas las edades.
LOCATION:Cornelius Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fa923043b41b3d006473ce
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Russian Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T134500
UID:69a096d68b29ea2800d2ab0f@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Stories\, songs\, and fun movement activities—all in Russian
 ! This program is perfect for little ones accompanied by their adults and 
 lasts 30–40 minutes. Please join us on the fourth Sunday of each month a
 t 1:00 p.m.\nЧтение книг\, детские песни и подв
 ижные игры на русском языке! Программа п
 роводится для детей в сопровождении взр
 ослых и длится 30-40 минут. Будем рады встр
 ече с вами каждое четвертое воскресенье 
 месяца в час дня\, в теплой дружественной
  обстановке.\n#worldlanguagestorytimes
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Brookwood
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a096d68b29ea2800d2ab0f
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
