BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Makerspace Open Lab
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T180000
UID:6a0f6c928360de907d87f7b3@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Makerspace Open Labs are for anyone who wants to check out the
  space and use our equipment to make cool things. Room assistants are avai
 lable to guide you in the basic use of the tools and technology. Come in w
 ith an idea and leave with a finished project! For more information about 
 the Makerspace and its resources\,\nsee here\n.\nMakerspace Open Labs take
  place on the following weekly schedule:\nTuesdays\n\, 5:30 - 7:30PM\nThur
 sdays\n\, 4:00 - 6:00PM\nSaturdays\n\, 10:00 AM - 1:00PM\nSundays\n\, 1:30
  - 5:30P\nNOTE: no Makerspace on Saturday\, July 4.\nEach month we provide
  the materials\, tools and instructions for a featured Makerspace project 
 that everyone is invited to try.\nJul\ny's featured project is Kandi Star 
 Keychains.\nIMPORTANT:\nAdults using the Makerspace for the first time nee
 d to\nsign a waiver\n\; people under the age of 18 must have a waiver sign
 ed by a parent or guardian.\nYou can sign and submit waivers online here.
LOCATION:Tualatin Public Library\, Makerspace
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0f6c928360de907d87f7b3
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
