BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Miniature Castle Contest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260713T235959
UID:6a12479e8ea300e2631822aa@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:It's time for the yearly Miniature Castle Contest! Make a litt
 le castle to display at the library. You may even win an award.\nUse whate
 ver materials you'd like to make a castle no bigger than 7 inches by 7 inc
 hes by 7 inches. Castles can be made alone or in groups by people of all a
 ges. Entries are accepted July 1-13th.\nCastles will be voted on by librar
 y staff and the Sherwood Maid Marian court. Winners will be announced on J
 uly 17th to coincide with the annual Sherwood Robin Hood Festival.\nLearn 
 more about the festival here.\nFor more details or to download an entry fo
 rm\, click here\n. Make sure to print your form at the default size (not 
 scaled) if you'd like to use the 7 inch template to measure your castle.
LOCATION:Sherwood Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a12479e8ea300e2631822aa
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Digital Navigator Tech Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T140000
UID:6a12517ff6bd012f0069f4c3@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Digital Navigator Tech Help is held every Saturday in the libr
 ary except the 3rd Saturday of the month (when the library hosts computer 
 classes) from 10:00 a.m to 2:00 p.m. through July 25. Need help with devi
 ces? Have technology-related questions? Want help with job searches? Br
 ing your own device or use library computers.\nThese are drop-in hours onl
 y\, so first come\, first served.\nThis free program is provided by a visi
 ting Digital Navigator and is in partnership with AmeriCorps & Washington 
 County Cooperative Library Services.\nAlso see our\nTech Help Appointments
  offered by library staff.
LOCATION:Sherwood Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a12517ff6bd012f0069f4c3
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
